# Node descriptor providers, discovered via ServiceLoader.
#
# There used to be one hand-written provider per node here - 29 of them, each restating ports and
# parameters the node had already declared in Java. A node now declares its contract once, with
# @NodeSpec/@PortDoc/@ParamDoc on the very constants and fields it executes against, and the harvest
# is committed to /node-descriptors.json at build time (NodeSpecGoldenTest keeps it honest).
#
# So: one provider that reads that resource, plus a holding pen for the single contract that has no
# node class behind it.
io.metaloom.loom.nodes.spec.GeneratedNodeDescriptorProvider
io.metaloom.loom.nodes.spec.OrphanNodeDescriptorProvider
